# This repository stores LF for everything. build.sh, test-integration.sh and
# the systemd units are run on Linux, where a CRLF line ending fails as the
# baffling "bad interpreter: ^M" - an error no contributor should be able to
# cause just by cloning on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.go   text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
